'''Hikaru Saotome''' (早乙女 光 ''Saotome Hikaru'') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Kishidan Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 3.4 Update|Version 3.4]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Hikaru Saotome
|image = E 142.png
|appearance = [[Kishidan Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 460円 - 1,817円
}}

==Enemy==
An enemy with low attack power but high health, could be interpreted as this collab's version of [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Tank Cat]].

==Strategy==
Rangers such as [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cat]] and [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] can deal with this enemy without being outranged, but use meatshields to protect them.

